  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 300°F (150°C).",
    "Rinse the harees and wheat, and soak them in water for at least 4 hours.",
    "Drain and rinse the harees and wheat, then combine them in a large bowl.",
    "Add the chopped onion, minced garlic, olive oil, salt, black pepper, and cumin to the bowl.",
    "Mix well to combine.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a 9x13 inch baking dish.",
    "Cover the dish with aluminum foil and bake for 2 hours.",
    "Remove the foil and continue baking for an additional 30 minutes.",
    "Serve hot."
